Z||000007||88 Fiero||06-01-2001||10:56 AM||||Hmmmm....well if this guy is bragging a 300+ horsepower MR2 then so be it. Pending that he got plenty of cash to do it. Remember more horsepower means more money to spend. The problem with import and modifying them to achieve the 275+ horsepower is expensive. With a V8 you can play with it without costing so much money. I know a guy driving an eclipse supposedly running 300+ horsepower but spend thousands of dollars that he kept it a secret to his wife or he gets shot. Anyway.. I think he is just full of crap and probably jealous that you got a V8 on a fiero and he cant stuff one on his mr2. You know people that brag too much..most likely they cant afford to spend the money. They just want to look good and get attention.||||reg||1
